      "definitions": [
        {
          "content": "Extreme values of the error (of indication) of an EVSE, permitted by this Guide, when the current is varied (AC and DC EVSE) and voltage (DC EVSE) within the intervals given by the rated operating conditions, and when the EVSE is otherwise operated at reference conditions."
